---
layout: base.njk
title: "Commercial Renovation Insights | VNG Blog"
description: "Practical guides for project managers and building owners navigating commercial renovations across Ontario."
permalink: /blog/
---

<div class="bl-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:16px" class="r-left">From the Field</div>
    <h1 class="r-left">Commercial Renovation<br><span style="color:var(--red)">Insights.</span></h1>
    <p class="r-left">Practical knowledge for project managers, building owners, and anyone navigating a commercial renovation in Ontario.</p>
    <a href="/blog/feed.xml" class="bl-rss r-left" aria-label="RSS feed">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.18 15.64a2.18 2.18 0 0 1 2.18 2.18C8.36 19.01 7.38 20 6.18 20C4.98 20 4 19.01 4 17.82a2.18 2.18 0 0 1 2.18-2.18M4 4.44A15.56 15.56 0 0 1 19.56 20h-2.83A12.73 12.73 0 0 0 4 7.27V4.44m0 5.66a9.9 9.9 0 0 1 9.9 9.9h-2.83A7.07 7.07 0 0 0 4 12.93V10.1z"/></svg>
      RSS Feed
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="bl-listing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="bl-grid stagger" id="bl-grid">
      {% for post in collections.blog %}
      <article class="bl-card r{% if loop.index > 12 %} bl-hidden{% endif %}">
        <div class="bl-meta">
          <span>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
          <span class="bl-dot">·</span>
          <span>{{ post.data.readTime }} min read</span>
        </div>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="bl-read-more">Read Article <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="14" height="14"><path d="M3 13L13 3M6 3h7v7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if collections.blog.length > 12 %}
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:48px">
      <button class="btn" id="bl-show-more" style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:var(--gray2);padding:12px 32px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;background:transparent;cursor:pointer">Load More Articles</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-bg"><span>VNG</span></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="r-scale">
      <div class="cta-line"></div>
      <h2>Have a project in mind?<br>Let's <span class="accent">talk.</span></h2>
      <p>Every article here reflects something we've dealt with on site. Bring us your project and we'll tell you exactly how we'd handle it.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-red">Start a Conversation <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13L13 3M6 3h7v7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
